  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Primary Data Path",
      "items": [
        "Markdown in git is the source of truth; Blob holds the synchronized copy.",
        "sync_knowledge.py skips unchanged files using a content_sha256 Blob metadata hash.",
        "Foundry IQ generates the datasource, skillset, indexer and index; the agent answers only from retrieved chunks and cites the original Blob URLs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust & Ownership",
      "items": [
        "Keyless throughout: storage sets shared_access_key_enabled = false and Azure AI Search sets local_authentication_enabled = false.",
        "Terraform owns the Azure control plane; the deploy scripts own the data-plane objects Terraform cannot manage.",
        "Citation URLs point at a private container, so a client needs a proxy or user-delegation SAS to fetch a source directly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Scope, Status & Evidence",
      "items": [
        "Scope: the deployed Azure path through Phase 3 in canadacentral; the Phase 4 FastAPI gateway and Phase 5 Next.js UI run as local processes and are omitted.",
        "Verified 2026-09-19; phases 2 and 3 accepted, evidence in docs/verification/.",
        "Preview: Foundry IQ agentic retrieval, azure-search-documents 12.1.0b2, Search REST 2026-08-01-preview."
      ]
    }
  ]
